1
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:03,760
准备好点餐了吗
Hi, ready to order?

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,960
你们有什么特色[菜]说来听听
Do you have anything that's really special?

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,480
我高中辅导员说我没有特色
Not according to my high school guidance counselor.

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,480
那我要个蔬菜拼盘
I'll have the veggie plate.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,340
不要甜菜 换甘蓝
But instead of beets, I want kale.

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,600
不要花椰菜 再放点甘蓝
And instead of broccoli, more kale.

7
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,240
蔬菜要用蒸的
I want the veggies steamed.

8
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,040
色拉调料改用柠檬代替
And instead of dressing, I want lemons.

9
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,080
你怎么还不动笔记下来啊
Don't you need to write this down?

10
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,280
现在只有心情写遗书
I'm afraid if I start writing that down,

11
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,780
因为要被烦死了
it'll turn into a suicide note.

12
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,340
我猜你们都会这么点餐吧
I'm assuming this table's gonna have a lot more of those requests.

13
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,960
没错 看你们那帽就知道是事儿精
Yes, I could tell by the hats.

14
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,740
厄尔 我有新东西想你尝尝
Earl, I have something new I want you to try.

15
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,780
正是因为这句话
That's the exact same sentence

16
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,080
我才会在几十年前 染上吸毒的恶习
that got me hooked on cocaine in the '80s.

17
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,300
我说的是 蛋糕的新口味啦
It's my new cupcake flavor.

18
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,740
女人无法抗拒的美味黑巧克力口味
Delicious dark chocolate the ladies can't help but love.

19
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:57,900
我把它称为"黑伯爵厄尔"
I'm calling it "The Earl."

20
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,658
说得好
I know you got that right.

21
00:01:00,658 --> 00:01:03,260
我来了
Hi, I'm here.

22
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,380
本来我以为要迟到了 想说打个的吧
I was running late so I decided to hail a cab.

23
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:07,500
然后才想起我没带钱
And then I remembered I didn't have any money on me.

24
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:09,820
接着意识到我现在是两袖清风的穷光蛋
And then I remembered I didn't have any money at all.

25
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:12,160
所以我不辞辛苦地走来上班
So I walked the whole way here.

26
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:14,260
我家到这里才隔三条街
The apartment's three blocks away.

27
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:15,400
我知道
Yes, I know.

28
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,900
三条街 外加十五声"哟呵 妹子"那么远
Three blocks and 15 "hola chicas" away.

29
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,640
你不能再迟到了
Well, you can't be late again.

30
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:22,740
我够烦我每个月迟到的...
I'm already worried about me being late...

31
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,060
大姨妈了
every month.

32
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:27,880
在我来的路上 一位无家可归的流浪汉向我讨钱
On my way here, a homeless man asked me for money.

33
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:30,500
我跟他说 通常我都会慷慨解囊
And I told him that I usually always give,

34
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,880
但我的父亲因为非法敛财而被起诉了
but that my father was indicted in a Ponzi scandal

35
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:35,780
我们家产没了 曼哈顿豪宅也没了
and I've lost my family fortune and my Manhattan townhouse,

36
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:38,280
还得在布鲁克林区朋友家的沙发过夜
so I've been sleeping on a couch in Brooklyn, but,

37
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:40,260
尽管世事无常 但我还是对于
in spite of it all, I'm still optimistic

38
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:42,080
开小蛋糕店持乐观态度
that you and I will achieve success

39
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:44,620
并坚信未来将会取得成功
in our exciting new cupcake business venture.

40
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:46,460
瞧 看他给了我啥
And look what he gave me!

41
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:49,180
你连流浪汉的钱都拐啊
You took money from a homeless man?

42
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:53,420
应该说 是桥边的鲍勃入股投资才对
I prefer to think of Bob near the bridge as our first investor.

43
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:56,360
上菜 特制三明治
Pickup! Special sandwich.

44
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:59,120
我还想到一种更妙的三明治
I can think of even more special sandwich.

45
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:01,720
你 我 金发长颈鹿夹一起
You, me and the hot blonde giraffe.

46
00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:06,500
她破产后尊严全没了
Well, she recently lost her dignity,

47
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:07,620
搞不好她会愿意屈就
so you might have a shot.

48
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,000
今天好啊
Hello today!

49
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,800
我给你做了个名牌
I have nametag for you.

50
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,660
你才来第二天 我就给你备好名牌了
Only your second day and look, nametag already.

51
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,880
这新东家当的 太牛逼了
As new owner, I am killing it.

52
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,400
谢谢
Thank you.

53
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,560
上面写的是"卡洛淋"
Oh, it says "Carolin."

54
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,120
我叫卡洛"琳" 是"王"字旁
It's Caroline. With an "E".

55
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,160
我叫卡洛琳
I'm Caroline.

56
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,660
这新东家当的 太二逼了
As new owner, I am sucking it.

57
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:28,560
你就挂着就是了
Just put it on.

58
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,860
不能告诉亚洲人他犯了错误
You can't tell an Asian he made a mistake.

59
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,020
不然等会他就去拔剑自刎了
He'll go in the back and throw himself on a sword.

60
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,440
谢谢你 李老板
Thank you, Mr. Lee.

61
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,000
你可以叫我憨
You may call me Han.

62
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,220
勇"敢"的"心"
H-a-n.

63
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:39,800
好记不会错
No trap in my name.

64
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,960
我在想 我们可以迈出
I'm thinking we should take

65
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,920
我们蛋糕事业的第一步了
the first step in our new cupcake business

66
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:47,040
就在优惠餐板上
by writing "Max's Homemade Cupcakes"

67
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,100
写上"麦克斯自制蛋糕"吧
up on the specials board.

68
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,580
不行 姐的大名不能张扬
No, I can't have my name up there.

69
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,140
我的债主们都以为我住在西雅图呢
Everyone I owe money to thinks I live in Seattle.

70
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:56,080
哎 以前西雅图是我家的呢
Oh, we used to own Seattle.

71
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,960
麦克斯 你的名字一定得亮相
Max, we've got to get the name out there.

72
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,640
制造名气嘛
Create a buzz.

73
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:01,840
好棒 好棒
Ooh, good idea!

74
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,620
赶紧开始名气大作战
Let's create a buzz.

75
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:03,960
没错 要想打开市场
Exactly, in order to launch--

76
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:05,160
我是在模仿你那傻样儿
I'm mocking you.

77
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,600
以后别怀疑 我向来都是在嘲笑你
When in doubt, I'm always mocking you.

78
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:10,100
说真的 麦克斯
Seriously, Max.

79
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:12,320
这个蛋糕事业是我们的救生索
This new cupcake business is our lifeline.

80
00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:14,000
能助我们走上脱贫致富的道路呀
A way out for both of us.

81
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:17,040
我还想再次感谢你 让我搬进你家住
And I wanna thank you again for letting me move in.

82
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,100
如果有任何事我能帮得上忙的
If there's anything I can do to help you--

83
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:20,920
是指除了招待客人以外的忙吗
You mean besides starting to wait on tables?

84
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:24,600
我是说 任何能帮你平复
I meant, anything I can do to help you

85
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,800
和罗比分手的难过心情的事
through your breakup with Robbie.

86
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:29,120
谢了 我没事
Oh. Thanks, but I'm fine.

87
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:30,220
而且现在是我们工作时间
And we're working.

88
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,100
你不干活 我还干呢
Well, one of us is.

89
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:34,740
你确定你没事吗
Are you sure you're fine?

90
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,180
昨晚我听见你在哭
'Cause I heard you crying last night.

91
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:37,940
我才不哭
I don't cry.

92
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:41,140
早在两年前 我就把泪腺拿去器官银行卖钱了
I sold my tear ducts to an organ bank for cash two years ago.

93
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,340
当时我躺在沙发上
I was on the couch.

94
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:46,840
听到你在卧室里独自啜泣
And I heard you crying alone in your bedroom.

95
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:49,660
真的吗 那哭声听起来像啥样
Really? What did the crying sound like?

96
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:52,100
像这样...
Like...

97
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:57,900
我不是在哭
I wasn't crying.

98
00:03:58,220 --> 00:03:59,600
那你是在干嘛...
Well, then what were you d--

99
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:02,760
哎哟 那事我管不着
Oh! So none of my business.

100
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:04,240
正确
That's right.

101
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,960
-麻烦记住这点 -收到
- And remember that.- Got it.

102
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,300
事实上 任何有关于
In fact, let's just say that anything having to do

103
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:11,040
我卧室 我桌子 或我生活的事
with my bedroom, my tables, or my life--

104
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,120
你最好都别多管闲事
you should stay away from.

105
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,360
界限 明白
Boundaries. Got it.

106
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:17,260
而且千万不要告诉任何同事
And please don't tell anyone at work

107
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,520
我让你搬进我家住
I let you move into my apartment.

108
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:21,100
一说出去 后果难以想象
That is one boundary we both don't want crossed.

109
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:21,540
为什么
Why?

110
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,200
嗨 同居"蜜"友
Hey, roomies.

111
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:26,980
懂了吧
That's why.

112
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,540
希望你能睡得惯这床单
Hope those sheets are okay.

113
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:36,840
不用担心
Oh, don't worry about it.

114
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,240
我知道你就只能买这么好的了
I know they're the best you could afford.

115
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:41,260
其实不是 更好的我自己用着呢
Not really. The good ones are on my bed.

116
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:44,200
麦克斯 烤箱太热了
Max, that oven is so hot.

117
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:46,160
你能帮我开开后门吗
Could you do me a favor and open the back door?

118
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,900
我们才认识两天
We've known each other two days

119
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:49,520
你就想开我"后庭"啊
and you're already asking for back door?

120
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,560
上帝呀
Dear God!

121
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,980
我忘了你是骑师芭比
I forgot you're Equestrian Barbie.

122
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,100
买芭比还附赠马一只
You came with a horse.

123
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,860
不行
No.

124
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:09,060
出去 小马 不乖哦 大坏马
Out, horse, bad! Bad horse.

125
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:10,320
栗宝
Chestnut.

126
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:17,474
没必要嚷它 它可是冠军马
No need to yell, he's a champion.

127
00:05:17,474 --> 00:05:19,997
米田共臭度也是冠军
Champion stink bomb.

128
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:22,440
整个院子臭味四溢
It's smelling pretty ripe out in that yard.

129
00:05:22,700 --> 00:05:24,420
这不关栗宝的事 布鲁克林本来就这味儿
That's not Chestnut, that's Brooklyn.

130
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,640
好吧 我现在就看见"冠军马"
Okay, well, I'm watching "The Champion"

131
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,840
拉出几坨热气腾腾的"布鲁克林"呢
drop some steaming hot "Brooklyn" right now.

132
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:36,840
麦克斯 对于把名字写在板子上这件事
Max, I've been thinking about how you completely overreacted

133
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,520
我觉得你有点反应过大了
to your name up on the specials board.

134
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,300
你觉得那是对成功的恐惧吗
Do you think it's a fear of success?

135
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:43,400
我穷到恐惧不起成功
I am too poor to have a fear of success.

136
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:45,960
我在沃顿商学院学过
At Wharton Business School, we learned

137
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:48,380
但凡创业都会伴随着一定的恐惧
that every new venture can bring up a certain amount of fear.

138
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:51,580
我能去Yelp网上给沃顿点个差评之类的吗
Is there any way to do a yelp review of Wharton Business School?

139
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,160
或许因为没人相信过你和你的梦想
Maybe you're having a hard time imagining

140
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:58,140
所以你才无法想象
this cupcake business could ever even happen

141
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:00,760
这个蛋糕事业会有实现的一天
because nobody ever believed in you or your dreams.

142
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,120
我瞎猜的
I'm guessing.

143
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:05,820
我能帮你美梦成真 麦克斯
I can make this happen, Max.

144
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,980
为了我 为了你 为了我们
For me, for you, for us.

145
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:10,060
你就接着烘焙超好吃的小蛋糕
Just keep making those amazing cupcakes.

146
00:06:10,060 --> 00:06:11,940
其他我来做 做到你相信为止
And I'll do the rest till you believe.

147
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,520
我"相信"你说的每一句话
I believe everything you just said

148
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,380
我也"相信"孩子是未来的主人翁
and that children are the future.

149
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,580
麦克斯 是我
Max, it's me!

150
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:40,220
我知道是你
I know it's you.

151
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:43,400
你睡觉时 枕头底下还藏把刀啊
You sleep with a knife under your pillow?

152
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:46,360
这是我唯一付得起的家庭安保项目
It's the only home security system I can afford.

153
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:48,900
而且 割腕儿童欢乐多嘛
And I'm a cutter.

154
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,980
那沙发我睡不了
I can't sleep on that couch.

155
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:56,640
我想 "宜家"是脊椎"移架"的意思吧
I think Ikea might be the Scandinavian word for sciatica.

156
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,660
而且大街上有奇怪的声音
And there's weird sounds in the street.

157
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,400
我也没带助眠白噪音机
And I don't have my white noise machine.

158
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,620
只是波多黎各街头艺人在瞎吹奏嘛
Well, that's Puerto Rican noise.

159
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:04,500
你听听就会习惯
You'll get used to it.

160
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:07,660
我能躺在这睡一会儿吗
Can I just lay down here and get a little sleep?

161
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:10,140
我的男人都不准在这睡
I don't even let the men I sleep with sleep with me.

162
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:13,600
你的心里毛病我现在没力医
I can't get into your issues right now.

163
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,680
我只是想睡觉
I just need to sleep!

164
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,880
好吧 钻进来吧
Fine, get in then.

165
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,360
这是什么
What is that?

166
00:07:21,980 --> 00:07:23,580
薯片 我边睡边吃
Potato chips. I sleep-eat.

167
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:26,920
清凉牧场培根味
Cool ranch and bacon?

168
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,492
拜托 好吃到做梦也会笑
Dude, they're delicious.

169
00:07:28,492 --> 00:07:31,480
跟人分手就得自暴自弃吗
Because of your breakup with Robbie?

170
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:32,200
少废话快上来
Just get in.

171
00:07:32,420 --> 00:07:34,660
我五个小时后得去市里给人看孩子呢
I have to be in the city to babysit in five hours.

172
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,640
天啊 你就像盏灯
Oh, great, you're like a nightlight.

173
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,700
金发亮得真晃眼
You're so blonde.

174
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,340
多谢夸奖
Thank you.

175
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,340
