这样省得再勾起你的伤心事
Now you won't have to go through with all that mess.

357
00:15:22,620 --> 00:15:25,640
而且我还帮你教训了他一顿 开心吧
And I think you'd be pleased, I really let him have it.

358
00:15:26,940 --> 00:15:29,220
你搞毛啊 说好的界限呢
What is with you and boundaries?

359
