and now you go and call Robbie?

361
00:15:32,659 --> 00:15:34,552
你就像 你就像你那头大屁股的马一样
You're like-- you're like your big-ass horse.

362
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:36,300
在别人的地盘肆意妄为
Charging in everywhere you don't belong.

363
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,480
