And then you went and stole it.

385
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,640
但我猜你是情不自禁
But I guess you couldn't help it,

386
00:16:31,660 --> 00:16:33,680
你们钱宁家都是一路货色 偷东西的惯犯
'cause that's what you channings do, you steal things.

