谢谢
Thanks.

462
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,880
我 醉鬼卡洛琳 是个臭显摆骚货
"I, drunk Caroline, am a punk ass ho.

463
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:10,980
我保证以后不多嘴
I promise to keep my big mouth shut,

