并帮麦克斯补回吃掉的穷人薯片
"and replace all of Max's poor people chips.

465
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,260
我以后再也不干预她的恋"青"
I will no longer meddle in her relation-chips."

466
00:20:20,060 --> 00:20:22,100
在你狂吐之前 曾对此大笑不已
You laughed about that until you threw up.

467
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,860
我猜你心中可能有疑问
Oh, and if you're wondering,

